WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:21.797
Eddy raced.

2
00:00:21.798 --> 00:00:26.002
Most cars flew ahead of Eddy.

3
00:00:26.003 --> 00:00:30.428
But some cars were behind him.

4
00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:44.121
"At least I'm not last," Eddy thought.

5
00:00:44.122 --> 00:00:49.822
Then Eddy passed a car.

6
00:00:49.823 --> 00:00:53.374
"Cool!" said Eddy.

7
00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:58.472
Vroom! Eddy picked up speed.

8
00:00:58.473 --> 00:01:05.991
He went around the bend.

9
00:01:05.992 --> 00:01:14.226
Eddy passed another car.

10
00:01:14.227 --> 00:01:17.658
Then he passed another.

11
00:01:17.659 --> 00:01:20.417
"Wow!" said Eddy.

12
00:01:20.418 --> 00:01:28.310
"I really am fast!

13
00:01:28.311 --> 00:01:37.509
I'm going to make the team!"

14
00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:50.730
Eddy saw the finish line.

15
00:01:50.731 --> 00:02:00.179
He raced across it.

16
00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:03.833
"I won!" Zippy was shouting.

17
00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:06.065
Eddy looked over.

18
00:02:06.066 --> 00:02:10.314
Three other cars were with Zippy.

19
00:02:10.315 --> 00:02:14.253
They all had team stickers.

20
00:02:14.254 --> 00:02:20.302
"The four winners," thought Eddy.

21
00:02:20.303 --> 00:02:24.025
"Sorry, Eddy," said Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:24.026 --> 00:02:26.879
"You were pretty fast.

23
00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:34.875
But you didn't make the team."
